  "description": "Devilstrand is a specialist textile purchased through the smuggler supply network. Caravans carry 20–40 and settlements carry 40–80 per stock generation. It can be used where a recipe accepts its fabric category, retaining the material's existing protection and insulation effects.\n\nThe red bundle is imported stock. The supported Arrakis crop roster offers no local devilstrand-growing route; reclaimed sietch fiber and weaving provide ordinary Cloth instead.",
